[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraPunish/release/images/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraPunish is the moderation plugin of the series: bans, mutes, kicks and warnings via commands or a clean GUI with reason templates and automatically escalating punishments.
UltraPunish is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]Ban, temp-ban, mute, temp-mute, kick and warn
[*]Punish GUI with reason templates and escalating durations
[*]Full history per player
[*]IP bans and alt account detection
[*]Punishments are shown in each player's language, ban screen included
[*]Staff notifications and automatic actions after X warnings
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in the language files.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraPunish/release/images/gallery-1-layout.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-languages.png[/IMG]

[B]English · Deutsch · Français · Nederlands · Italiano[/B]
Every player sees UltraPunish in the language of their Minecraft client – automatically.
Players with any other language get your default language, which you set in the config or with [FONT=Courier New]/ultrapunish language <code>[/FONT].
All texts live in [FONT=Courier New]lang/<code>.yml[/FONT] and can be edited freely.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraPunish/release/images/gallery-2-languages.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraPunish/release/images/gallery-3-gui.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/punish <spieler>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Open the punish GUI [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.gui)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ban · /tempban <spieler> [dauer] [grund][/COLOR][/FONT] – Ban a player [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.ban)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/mute · /tempmute <spieler> [dauer] [grund][/COLOR][/FONT] – Mute a player [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.mute)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/banip <spieler> [grund][/COLOR][/FONT] – Ban a player and their IP [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.ban)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/kick <spieler> [grund][/COLOR][/FONT] – Kick a player [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.kick)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/warn <spieler> [grund][/COLOR][/FONT] – Warn a player [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.warn)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/unban · /unmute <spieler>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Revoke a punishment [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.revoke)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/history <spieler>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Show the history [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.history)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultrapunish <help|reload|version|language>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrapunish.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrapunish.notify[/FONT] – Receive staff notifications
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrapunish.exempt[/FONT] – Cannot be punished
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrapunish.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraPunish and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder. Works on [B]Spigot, Paper and Purpur 1.20.4+[/B] (Java 17+), no dependencies needed.
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and the files in [FONT=Courier New]lang/[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultrapunish reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
